  {
   "name": "intella/custom-section",
   "attrs": {
    "label": "How our SEO reseller partnership works",
    "html": "<section class=\"section section--white process\" aria-labelledby=\"process-title\">\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section-head section-head--center\">\n\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"section-title\" id=\"process-title\">How our SEO reseller <span class=\"accent\">partnership works</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"section-lead\">Simple to start, easy to scale.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<ol class=\"steps-row\" role=\"list\">\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"steps-row__item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"steps-row__num\">01</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"steps-row__title\">You win the client</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>You sell SEO under your brand. We can help with audits and proposals.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"steps-row__item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"steps-row__num\">02</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"steps-row__title\">We plan and deliver</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our team does the audit, the fixes, the content and the links.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"steps-row__item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"steps-row__num\">03</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"steps-row__title\">You report</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>White-label reports go out with your logo and your name.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li class=\"steps-row__item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"steps-row__num\">04</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"steps-row__title\">Grow together</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Add clients and services whenever you need more capacity.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>",
    "css": "white-label-seo",
    "modules": []
   }
